MediScribe AI

Clinical AI Copilot

MediScribe AI is an enterprise healthcare software platform designed to assist physicians during patient consultations.

The system is intended to reduce physician documentation workload and provide structured, evidence-supported clinical decision support while keeping the physician in full control of clinical decisions.

Core Concept

During a medical consultation, the physician and patient communicate naturally.

The system captures the conversation through appropriate audio input, identifies speakers, converts the conversation into text, extracts clinically relevant information, and generates a structured clinical record.

The long-term system then analyzes the available information and provides physician-facing clinical decision support.

