Primary User

The primary user is the physician.

The physician should be able to:

* Search for a patient
* Open the patient profile
* Review medical history
* Review medications
* Review allergies
* Review previous consultations
* Review vital signs
* Start a consultation
* Record the consultation
* View live transcription
* Review extracted clinical information
* Review AI-generated clinical documentation
* Review AI-generated clinical decision support
* Edit AI content
* Accept recommendations
* Reject recommendations
* Modify recommendations
* Finalize the clinical note
* Sign the consultation

